  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1603.02 Maximum Sulfur Content of Imported Liquid Fuels Effective July 1, 2018",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1603.02 Maximum Sulfur Content of Imported Liquid Fuels Effective July 1, 2018. On and after July 1, 2018, no person shall import into the state any of the following liquid fuels with a sulfur content greater than that specified in RSA 125-C:10-d, I, reprinted in Appendix B:\n\n(a) No. 2 oil, also referred to as distillate oil;\n\n(b) No. 4 oil; or\n\n(c) No. 5 oil or No. 6 oil, also referred to as residual oil.\n\nSource. #12694, eff 12-22-18; ss by #13808, eff 11-18-23; ss by #13808, eff 11-18-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1600.html"
